Files covered by Sentinel Proprietary License:
  - lib/sentinel-audit.mjs          (audit engine + certificate signing)
  - lib/sentinel-l16.mjs            (L1.6 static analysis: Semgrep + secrets + OSV)
  - lib/sentinel-l2-trigger.mjs     (L2 Docker sandbox trigger)
  - api/audit-skill.js              (audit endpoint + certificate lookup)
  - scripts/l2-analyze.py           (L2 behavioral analysis)
  - scripts/l2-build-docker.sh      (L2 Docker image builder)
  - scripts/l2-parse-url.py         (L2 URL parser)
  - scripts/audit-all-skills.mjs    (batch certification script)
  - scripts/generate-badges.mjs     (badge generator)
  - .github/workflows/sentinel-l16-audit.yml
  - .github/workflows/sentinel-l2-sandbox.yml
  - .github/workflows/sentinel-l2-reaudit.yml
  - .github/workflows/sentinel-certify-all.yml
  - The Sentinel certificate format (MN-SC-YYYY-XXXXXXX)
  - The 3-layer audit pipeline design (L1.5 → L1.6 → L2)
  - The certificate signing algorithm (SHA-256 + secret)
  - The behavioral analysis patterns (network_attempts, credential_leakage, etc.)
  - The execution_status taxonomy (ran, ran_idle, failed_to_start)

